    "body": "Thanks for filing! However I'm not sure I understand. The algorithm assigns a list of header cells to a given data cell. But then, below it, there are criteria for whether a given header cell is a column header or row header. So yes, we don't produce two sets, but it's pretty clear how to do that, given the set and a way of splitting the set into two.\r\n\r\nWhat am I missing?",
